+
+---
+
+#### [Surya](https://github.com/datalab-to/surya)
+> **Description:** Surya focuses on OCR, layout analysis, reading order, table recognition, and LaTeX OCR across more than 90 languages. The README explicitly frames it as a document OCR toolkit that benchmarks well against cloud services and supports challenging layouts. That matters for restaurant operators dealing with photo-based menus, multi-column wine lists, supplier sheets, or franchise packets where reading order and table structure matter as much as raw text extraction. It is more ambitious than a plain OCR engine and can serve as the front-end of a full ingestion pipeline. GitHub shows roughly 19.5k stars, Python as the primary language, GPL-3.0 licensing, and activity on March 1, 2026.
+
+- **GitHub:** [github.com/datalab-to/surya](https://github.com/datalab-to/surya)
