+> **Description:** Darts is a user-friendly time-series library with classical statistical models, machine-learning models, deep learning models, and anomaly detection under one interface. The README emphasizes `fit()` and `predict()` consistency, support for multivariate series, backtesting, covariates, probabilistic forecasting, and anomaly scorers. For restaurant groups, that makes it useful when demand signals extend beyond one series and depend on weather, promotions, events, locations, or menu changes. It is more flexible than Prophet when teams want to compare many modeling families in one codebase. GitHub shows around 9.1k stars, Python as the main language, Apache-2.0 licensing, and activity on November 27, 2025.
