+
+> The best AI tools for restaurants 2026 are not a single POS plugin or hype-filled SaaS dashboard. They are practical open source building blocks you can self-host from GitHub for menu OCR, guest messaging, ordering flows, internal knowledge search, and demand forecasting. This list only includes tools that exist as public GitHub repositories and are relevant to real restaurant operations.
