+### Forecasting And Planning
+
+#### [Prophet](https://github.com/facebook/prophet)
+> **Description:** Prophet is one of the best-known forecasting libraries for business time series with multiple seasonalities and holiday effects. The README explains its additive model, robustness to missing data and trend shifts, and suitability for series with strong weekly, daily, and yearly patterns. Restaurants can use it for traffic forecasts, order volume, reservation demand, labor planning, and purchasing windows, especially when operators need interpretable models rather than a large MLOps stack. It remains a pragmatic choice for historical sales and covers many common planning problems well. GitHub shows a large user base, Python as the primary language, MIT licensing, and topic-page activity on October 21, 2025.
